</ul><select class="b-flag-select__input d-none countries" data-actions-box="true" data-initial-value=""></select><div class="b-flag-select__flag mar-xs-rt flex-grow-1"><i class="wu-flag d-none flag__1x1 bdr-clr-idel bdr-thin-all bdr-radius-cir wu-flag__spacing-scale-md"></i></div><div class="b-flag-select__output d-flex flex-column align-items-start justify-content-center flex-grow-1 w-100 mar-xs-rt"><div id="listboxFlagSelect" class="b-flag-select__label w-100 font-body-sm text-wu-dark opac-50">Invia a</div><div class="b-flag-select__value overflow-hidden white-space-nowrap font-body-reg w-100 text-wu-dark text-ellipsis"></div><input placeholder="Search..." class="b-flag-select__search-field d-none overflow-hidden white-space-nowrap font-body-reg w-100 text-wu-dark bdr-none pad-xs-none"></div><div class="b-flag-select__arrow pointer-events-none flex-grow-1"><i data-grunticon-embed="" class="wu-icon icon-0024_dropdown-more wu-icon-heading__sm sapphire"></i></div></div></div><div class="col-M-8 mar-sm-tp"><div class="wu-input--container wu-input--dropdown-action__box bdr-clr-idel bdr-thin-all bk-white bdr-radius-XL"><input data-number-valid="" autocomplete="off" inputmode="numeric" name="wu-input" class="wu-input bdr-none amount" placeholder="200.00" data-value="200.00" id="wu-input-EUR"> <label for="wu-input-EUR" class="wu-input--label text-wu-dark opac-50">Importo da inviare</label> <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="wu-input--icon__right wu-action-link"><span class="wu-input--dropdown-action-text w-100 justify-content-end text-sapphire">EUR</span></a></div></div><div class="col-M-16 pad-sm-tp d-block d-M-flex"><div class="align-items-center fx-container d-none"><p class="font-body-sm pad-xl-rt font-weight-medium">FX: <span class="font-body-sm font-weight-regular">1.00 EUR = <span class="font-body-sm fx-to"></span></span></p></div><div class="fee-container d-none"><p class="font-body-sm mar-xs-rt font-weight-medium">Commissione: <span class="fee font-body-sm font-weight-regular"></span></p><div data-enable-tooltip="" data-position="bottom center" class="d-inline-flex"><i data-grunticon-embed="" class="wu-icon icon-0109_r2-info wu-icon-heading__sm d-inline-flex"></i><div class="wu-tooltip"><div class="wu-tooltip__body font-body-sm"><small>I tassi di cambio e le commissioni variano in base alle opzioni di pagamento e sono soggetti a modifiche. Per verificare altre opzioni, fai clic su "Invia adesso".</small></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-M-16 pad-S-sm-tp sp-hero-banner-field d-none"><div class="d-flex align-content-center align-items-center"><i data-grunticon-embed="" class="wu-icon icon-0152_Tips-icon d-inline-flex wu-icon__sm mar-S-xs-rt"></i><div class="text-L-left font-weight-regular"><p id="social-proofing-message" class="wu-social-proofing font-body-sm">80% customers take less than 6 minutes to complete an online transfer with WU.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-L-8 pad-md-tp"><a href="/it/it/web/send-money/start?ReceiveCountry=IN&amp;SendAmount=200.00&amp;FundsOut=BA&amp;FundsIn=CreditCard" class="wu-btn wu-btn--dark wu-btn--round text-action-light wu-btn--action-light-ghost" data-linkname="btn-home-get-started" data-id="button_get-started" id="home-get-started" amplitude-id="button-calculator" mparticle-event-name="clicked_button">Invia ora</a></div><div class="col-16 pad-md-tp"><div class="d-flex align-content-center align-items-center"><i data-grunticon-embed="" class="wu-icon icon-0107_security d-inline-flex wu-icon-heading__lg mar-xs-rt"></i><div class="font-body-reg text-wu-dark"><strong>Informati. Fai attenzione. </strong><a href="/it/it/fraudawareness/fraud-home.html" class="font-body-reg text-wu-dark"><u>Proteggiti dalle frodi.</u></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-L-7 col-M-16 d-flex position-relative"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221080%22%20height%3D%22860%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201080%2